description:
We welcome a group of local artists to exhibit a special collection of their paintings, sculptures, drawings, pottery and more for the public.
Together we transform Cafe Ray into a constellation of curiosities and a celebration of independent art, with a spirit of fun and collaboration at the core.
Find the perfect Christmas gift and connect with local creators.
